# 50 — Documentation

공통 SoT: [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md)  
폴더 구조: [documentation-structure.mdc](documentation-structure.mdc)

## Canonical (SoT)

- `docs/CURRENT_WORK.md` — 현재 작업만
- `docs/PROJECT_IMPLEMENTATION_STATUS.md` — 구현 현황
- `docs/STEP_MASTER_STATUS.md` — STEP 상태
- `docs/ROADMAP.md` — 잔여 작업
- `docs/DECISION_LOG.md` — 장기 결정

완료보고·과거 STEP README는 **Historical** — SoT를 대체하지 않음.

## STEP 완료 시 필수 갱신

CURRENT_WORK · IMPLEMENTATION_STATUS · STEP_MASTER · ROADMAP

## 보존

- 삭제 전 Archive 우선. 사용자 승인 없는 삭제·이동 금지.
- 상대 링크 유지. 신규 제품 MD는 `docs/<domain>/`.
- 완료보고 예정 경로: `docs/archive/completion-reports/`

## Before creating a new Markdown file

1. Prefer updating existing canonical docs (`docs/ARCHITECTURE|AUTO_TRADING|OPERATIONS|DEVELOPMENT|DATABASE|TROUBLESHOOTING.md`).
2. Do **not** create per-task report Markdown at repo root.
3. Store detailed work history in `operation.ai_development_work_history`.
4. Store runtime evidence in `.run/` only (JSON preferred).
5. Archive obsolete one-time docs under `docs/archive/`.
6. Never create root-level AUDIT/RESULT/VERIFY markdown unless explicitly requested.

